      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the SOP for our new mRNA vaccine distribution route. Can you put together a comprehensive checklist of the technical requirements we need to maintain the cold chain throughout international transit? We need to ensure temperature stability from the manufacturing site to the final clinic.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
